 \"[\"Abena\", \"Akosua\", \"Kofi\", \"Kweku\", \"Peter\"]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To sort the elements of your sequence in descending order, pass the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"greater-than operator (","type":"text"},{"code":">","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"sorted(by:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let descendingStudents = students.sorted(by: >)","print(descendingStudents)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Peter\", \"Kweku\", \"Kofi\", \"Akosua\", \"Abena\"]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The sorting algorithm is guaranteed to be stable. A stable sort","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"preserves the relative order of elements that compare as equal.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" log ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the length of the sequence.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/scalar\/allscalars-swift.struct\/sorted()"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/AllScalars-swift.struct"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"Swift","externalID":"s:STsSL7ElementRpzrlE6sortedSayABGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s7UnicodeO6ScalarV12_RegexParserE10AllScalarsV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"na